      "message": "```suggestion\nWe rolled out CalyxOS 8 to all supported devices in the beginning of October. You may have read the details in our regular release posts. If not, you can find the highlights [here](https://calyxos.org/news/2026/10/01/android-17-is-here/). Changes include substantial updates to our device-flasher and our Web Installer is now much easier to use and can accommodate an expanded set of devices.\n```",
