      "writtenOn": "2026-11-09T19:16:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "```suggestion\nNext up is the Pixel QPR1 update. We are currently testing the reverse-engineered ports for the Pixel 6, 7, 8, and 9 series. The platform codebase will remain on the initial Android 17 release as QPR1 is not officially on AOSP. However, this means we will be able to use the latest proprietary components on these devices rather than relying on older ones. Please keep an eye on our [CalyxOS Testers Matrix channel](https://matrix.to/#/#calyxos-testers:matrix.org) if you are interested in testing out these images!\n```",
