      "side": 1,
      "message": "```suggestion\n* **CalyxOS App Updater**: this is our updater for key system apps such as CalyxOS Chromium (and its components such as Trichrome library and WebView) and microG. These apps are built and signed with our HSM-backed Calyx keys. The Lupin Updater allows us to ship updates straight to you without waiting for a full OS release so you can get faster and automatic security fixes for the apps you rely on the most.\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 42,
        "startChar": 329,
